Package: adreno-opencl-dev
Architecture: arm64
Description: Qualcomm Adreno GPU userspace driver - OpenCL headers
 Adreno provides hardware acceleration through Collection of prebuilt
 User Mode libraries to support OpenCL APIs for Qualcomm Adreno GPUs.
 .
 This package provides the Qualcomm vendor extension headers
 (cl_ext_qcom.h) for OpenCL on Adreno.
Section: non-free/libdevel
Depends:
 ocl-icd-opencl-dev,
 ${misc:Depends},

